#9116
An Old Dead Tree~
   You stand in the great forest beside the listing remains of a large
conifer. Its trunk split nearly to ground level, and wood burned black at its
upper reaches, it appears to have been struck by lightning some years ago. The
crack in its massive trunk widens at nearly eye-level, offering a nifty winter
abode for some small woodland creature.
