#9280
On the Lake~
   The pristine waters of Lake Argos stretch out before you, a large island
clearly visible towards the center of the lake. Steam rises slowly from a
number of areas around you and touching the water's surface with your hand,
you soon learn why - the water is quite warm, even hot in some places.
~
