#9282
On the Lake~
   Looking into the depths of the lake, you notice all manner of creatures
which appear unaffected by the heat of the water. Although swimming close to
the surface, the water is almost at boiling point as evident by the large
collection of bubbles breaking the surface, making capture of such creatures
impossible.
~
