A Pathway Deep within the Forest~
   You travel along a small path running through a forest of immensely tall
and majestic trees. All around you, the forest continues, the tall pines
streaking high into the cloudy sky. The path ends here at the entrance to a
pass through the mountains which rise immediately above you. Opening to the
north, the pass is wide enough for two horses to walk side by side, but any
more than that would have to walk single file. The path continues to the south.
~
