#9941
On the Lake~
   The water of this lake is almost crystal clear, perhaps run-off from the
snow-capped peak of Mount Kolvir which towers above the clouds to the
northeast. Lake Argos is reknowned for its thermal activity and many
travellers stop at its shores to bathe in the warm water.
~
